ntary】 Female shamans are called "wū,"</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-441e541a-bf97-4bb8-8edd-5bab49dad65b" orig=""><orth>巫</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">wū</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-500b3fa8-3b7e-4ab3-b422-4083a84bc651"><gramGrp>
